      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al principio, la tierra nueva era plana, y muy blanda y mojada.",
          "en": "At first, the new earth was flat, and very soft and wet."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los animales mandaron aves a ver si ya estaba seca. Pero las aves no encontraron dónde posarse.",
          "en": "The animals sent birds down to see if it was dry yet. But the birds found nowhere to land."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por fin mandaron al Gran Zopilote, el padre de todos los zopilotes.",
          "en": "At last, they sent the Great Buzzard, the father of all buzzards."
        },
        {
          "es": "'Baja y prepárala para nosotros', le dijeron.",
          "en": "'Go down and make it ready for us,' they told him."
        }
