      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El Gran Zopilote voló por toda la tierra, bajito, cerca del suelo.",
          "en": "The Great Buzzard flew all over the earth, low down, close to the ground."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando llegó a la tierra de los cherokee, estaba muy cansado.",
          "en": "When he reached the land of the Cherokee, he was very tired."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus alas empezaron a aletear y a golpear el suelo blando. Donde golpeaban, quedaba un valle.",
          "en": "His wings began to flap and strike the soft ground. Wherever they struck, there was a valley."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y donde volvían a subir, quedaba una montaña.",
          "en": "And wherever they turned up again, there was a mountain."
        }
      ],
