      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los animales de arriba se preocuparon. '¡Pronto todo el mundo va a ser montañas!', dijeron.",
          "en": "The animals up above were worried. 'Soon the whole world will be mountains!' they said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que llamaron al Zopilote para que volviera.",
          "en": "So they called the Buzzard back."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el país cherokee sigue lleno de montañas hasta hoy.",
          "en": "But the Cherokee country is full of mountains to this day."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Alguna vez viste las montañas Great Smoky? ¿Te parecen marcas de unas alas gigantes?",
          "en": "Have you ever seen the Great Smoky Mountains? Do they look like the marks of giant wings to you?"
        }
      ],
